// # TypeScript / NPM Web Ecosystem Unified Standard Library Facade
//
// Logline: Unified master entry point providing complete TypeScript and NPM parity across validators, dates, lodash, IDs, JWT, markup, and routing.
//
// Setup: Pure module shim importing all 49 web ecosystem companion submodules.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Import 49 modular web ecosystem subcomponents.
//   2. Re-export public constructors, validation builders, formatters, and utility functions.
//   3. Maintain full compliance with openOODA Standard Library specification.

